{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（8日）上午10時42分，油麻地京士柏山道33號，一名男工於屋苑一大廈的大堂進行工程期間，被電鋸鋸傷右手手指。人員接報到場替傷者包紮，然後送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。警方正調查意外成因，案件列工業意外有人受傷處理。</p><figure><img alt=\"男工人遭電鋸切傷手指，清醒送院。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260908/1173959030230487040230514.jpeg/jU96hYFWVIFanMhJmItsUWtAZiWjvMnZyV2hCexdoQk\"/><figcaption>男工人遭電鋸切傷手指，清醒送院。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"受傷男工由救護車送院。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260908/1173959851622010880215483.jpeg/awQLijzh8_FOD-LYsQQrXs_vUCVqt-zyYNO4_0XTuP8\"/><figcaption>受傷男工由救護車送院。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"受傷男工由救護車送院。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260908/1173959854394576896938657.jpeg/zO3YYn0xgAncIBySvSU65AoUa_GhO_p_EKjvVjWo71Y\"/><figcaption>受傷男工由救護車送院。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者由工友陪同送院。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260908/1173959856835792896407369.jpeg/L2YD125nP1I-15n66YQUexL2bCh8pIBgy9l7_u7Ze_4\"/><figcaption>傷者由工友陪同送院。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-08T03:58:49.722453+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}